      "type": "birthstones-section",
      "name": "Birthstones",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_171.png",
        "heading": "June: Pearl & Alexandrite",
        "description": "<p>Some months have more than one birthstone, which is the case for June.</p><p><br/>Pearls are the original organic fashion accessory, dating back thousands of years in many countries and cultures. According to ancient Chinese mythology, pearls came from the tears of dragons when the fabled beasts fought. In the Book of Matthew, he writes about “casting pearls before swine.” And, many know of Cleopatra’s famous bet with Marc Anthony when the queen of Egypt crushed a pearl and put it in her drink, proving she could spend the most on a single meal. These lustrous gems are the birthstone for June babies. And, pearls are the primary gift for those celebrating their 3rd and 30th anniversaries, and, are the alternate gifts for couples celebrating their 1st and 12th anniversaries.</p>",
        "image_position": "first",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0,
        "margin_top": 75,
